    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d484">

                <pb facs="0730" n="1239" sameAs="frus:frus1948v05p2/pg1239"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">501.BB Palestine/7–2648: Circular telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Certain Diplomatic and
                        Consular Offices </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-07-26T01:00:00-04:00">July 26, 1948—1 a.
                            m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Reference SC Resolution Jul 15 regarding renewal truce in Palestine and Israel
                    Dept considers acceptance by Israel and various Arab states as unconditional.
                    Dept considers differing views of Arabs and Israelis re immigration and other
                    matters are subjects for consideration by Mediator and do not in any way
                    invalidate truce.</p>
                <p>Sent to Baghdad, Cairo, Damascus, Beirut, Jidda, Amman, Jerusalem, Tel Aviv.</p>
                <p>Rptd to London for communication to FonOff.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Marshall</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
